      <h1 class="jr-h1">How Much Collagen Per Day? The Doses the Trials Actually Used</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">There is no official daily requirement for collagen, so the useful answer comes from what the trials gave people. The numbers differ by goal, and by a factor of 250 between the two kinds of collagen on Indian shelves, which is where most buyers go wrong.</p>

